  "aiSummary": "This Senate resolution confirms Teena Piccione as the State Chief Information Officer and Secretary of the Department of Information Technology. The confirmation was adopted by the Senate on May 22, 2025, following the standard confirmation process for this cabinet-level position.",
  "aiProArguments": "Supporters of this confirmation would argue that Teena Piccione has the qualifications and experience necessary to lead the state's information technology operations and manage the Department of Information Technology. Confirming a qualified CIO ensures stable leadership for critical state IT systems that serve all North Carolina agencies and citizens.",
